TASK B2: Parse the config file
branch: gang/B2
wave: 2

GOAL
Load config.yaml into a typed Config and reject unknown keys.

SCOPE
write:
- internal/config/**
shared:
- Makefile
peers:
- C3

CONTEXT
depends_on:
- A1
merge_after: none
requirements:
- ENG-25 (spec/10-engineering.md:670)
- ENG-27 (source not in plan)
consumes:
- file:config.yaml
produces:
- py:config.load

ACCEPTANCE
- Unknown keys fail with exit 1.
- Defaults fill missing keys.

VERIFY
tests_first:
- TestLoadRejectsUnknownKeys
commands:
- go test ./internal/config/...
gate:
- make check

TIMEBOX
lines: 300
minutes: 45

FORBIDDEN
- git stash
- force-push
- edit go.mod

REPORT
Return the JSON object your prompt names. Write your report with gang report.

STANDING
1. Run make check before every commit.
2. No new dependencies.

OWNER RULINGS
Ruling: keys are case sensitive.

PRIOR REPORT
<DIR>/run/tasks/B2/report.md
